## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/main/java/<% .JavaPath %>/App.java` | The program (package `<% .JavaPackage %>`) |
| `src/test/java/<% .JavaPath %>/` | JUnit tests |
| `pom.xml` | Maven build: Java 25, JUnit, and the jar's main class |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

The Java package comes from the module path (`-m github.com/<user>/<repo>` gives `io.github.<user>`), or
`com.example` if none was given. Rename it to your own reversed domain.

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
